OL,3,GNEWSAWoman suffered racial harassment
OL,4,Aat work - tribunal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA black council worker was subjected to
OL,7,F"serious racial abuse" and faced with
OL,8,F"dismissive" managers when she
OL,9,Fcomplained about it, an employment
OL,10,Ftribunal found.
OL,12,FThe woman was an intervention worker in
OL,13,FWest Berkshire Council's Youth Justice
OL,14,FSupport Team when two boys inflicted
OL,15,Fthe abuse in April 2024.
OL,17,FAuthority managers were found to have
OL,18,Finferred to the woman that "absorbing
OL,19,Fthat kind of abuse simply 'went with
OL,20,Fthe territory'".
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
